  "risks": [
    "Endpoint /reports/{id}/mainteiner contains a spelling error (mainteiner vs maintainer) which may cause confusion.",
    "Public endpoint /reports/approved lacks authentication requirement but returns sensitive data if not filtered correctly.",
    "State transitions for verification codes rely on client-side code handling which is not documented in the API spec.",
    "Admin endpoints like /admin/createuser lack specific role requirements documentation beyond auth_required flag."
